1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
EP002 The Perfect Alibi

2
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:07,440
Klein, get up.

3
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:08,640
It's time to go.

4
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:11,680
Hurry the fuck up, Klein! I said move it!

5
00:00:15,065 --> 00:00:17,065
Geez, officer, what is the rush?

6
00:00:18,265 --> 00:00:20,345
Most people wanna get out of here faster.

7
00:00:23,225 --> 00:00:24,985
Don't drive recklessly again.

8
00:00:25,705 --> 00:00:27,785
Next time, it won't be just three days.

9
00:00:28,105 --> 00:00:29,705
I can't make any promises, officer.

10
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:41,740
Daniel, everything going according to plan?

11
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,460
Yes, boss.

12
00:00:43,235 --> 00:00:45,635
You being in jail is the perfect alibi.

13
00:00:45,955 --> 00:00:47,795
Your father doesn't suspect a thing.

14
00:00:48,995 --> 00:00:51,555
Oh, and what about the Quinn family? Any issues there?

15
00:00:51,795 --> 00:00:52,435
No.

16
00:00:52,915 --> 00:00:55,155
The Quinns have agreed to marry their daughter to you.

17
00:00:55,155 --> 00:00:56,355
Huh, interesting.

18
00:00:56,595 --> 00:00:57,795
They kept their end of the bargain.

19
00:01:01,203 --> 00:01:02,403
You got it, boss.

20
00:01:02,403 --> 00:01:04,243
This is the final puzzle piece.

21
00:01:04,243 --> 00:01:05,203
To be continued

22
00:01:05,203 --> 00:01:05,923
So it begins.

